{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53577","headline":"咏廿四气诗 惊蛰二月节 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 惊蛰二月节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳气初惊蛰，韶光大（一作「天」）地周。\n桃花开蜀锦，鹰老化春（一作「爲」）鸠。\n时候争催迫，萌芽牙{丿爲丶}（一作「护」）矩修。\n人间务生事，耕种满田畴。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}